    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2690c92580b1a26373717452",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "由于对马娘和粉丝形成的社区存在方式感兴趣\n偶然来到了这里。自那以后，自己也成为了『社区民』。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c060319423272f613ffd965c50378089cc416884c5be91e2e185ac4b5856c1c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
